ropy</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FChowEtAl%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fappd-overview-ricci-flow%23def%3Achow-ii-appd-perelman-invariants\">↗ def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-invariants</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. appD:D.38</span></span>\\group Perelman Invariants <p></p>If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g(t)$\">$g(t)$</span> is a closed Ricci flow and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tau &#x27;(t)=-1$\">$\\tau &#x27;(t)=-1$</span> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\tau &gt;0$\">$\\tau &gt;0$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\mu (g(t_2),\\tau (t_2))\\geq \\mu (g(t_1),\\tau (t_1)) \\qquad (0\\leq t_1\\leq t_2).  \\]\">\\[  \\mu (g(t_2),\\tau (t_2))\\geq \\mu (g(t_1),\\tau (t_1)) \\qquad (0\\leq t_1\\leq t_2).  \\]</span> ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appd-overview-ricci-flow#thm:chow-ii-appd-improved-no-local-collapsing","next":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appd-overview-ricci-flow#lem:chow-ii-appd-mu-cheeger-gromov","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appd-overview-ricci-flow#def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-energy-entropy","title":"def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-energy-entropy","label":"def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-energy-entropy"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appd-overview-ricci-flow#def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-invariants","title":"def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-invariants","label":"def:chow-ii-appd-perelman-invariants"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/ChowEtAl/blueprint/src/chapters/appd-overview-ricci-flow#thm:chow-ii-appd-shrinking-breathers","title":"thm:chow-ii-appd-shrinking-breathers","label":"thm:chow-ii-appd-shrinking-breathers"},{"kind":